WEBVTT

00:07:58.834 --> 00:08:01.418
into decision-making, maybe.

00:08:02.049 --> 00:08:04.470
But somehow this worked out.

00:08:04.987 --> 00:08:07.490
And from one day to the other,

00:08:07.514 --> 00:08:09.067
we were all over the place.

00:08:09.666 --> 00:08:12.890
And I, from one day to the other,

00:08:12.914 --> 00:08:14.515
became a climate activist.

00:08:17.459 --> 00:08:18.754
Usually,

00:08:19.983 --> 00:08:22.250
in these kind of TED Talks,

00:08:22.274 --> 00:08:25.263
I would now say how it's overly hopeful,

00:08:25.287 --> 00:08:27.763
how we young people
are going to get this sorted,

00:08:27.787 --> 00:08:31.231
how we're going to save the future
and the planet and everything else,